  "greetingText": "你好，我是米霍尔。",
  "playerReplyText": "你要做什么？",
  "concernText": "你怎么了？你看起来好像不太好",
  "freeDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "我想……我可能要请你离开这里。我没有恶意，但是这件事说起来十分复杂",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_149ycwsgf7",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "虽然时间不够了，但还有一些时间。我需要想想这件事应该从哪说起？",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_qmmmckiuej",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "也许应该从十年前，那时我居住的地方非常糟糕。",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_sfhbsh82no",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你肯定难以想象那是一个什么样的地方，即使是如今的我也不愿意主动回忆。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_ilx7eq455a",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但是现在情况有点不同，所以我必须把这件事告诉你。",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_15wojpd89u",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "那个地方几乎很少见到阳光，大家似乎有很多烦恼，每个人的脸上都不太平静。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_klbhr2p5hv",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但我不知道他们的烦恼是什么，我年纪很小，只知道自己经常生病。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_41g4wuhsb7",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "我的病不只有一种，有时候会肚子疼，有时候会走不了路……",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_beng373wrt",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "所以，大部分时候我都一副无精打采的样子。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_oa19j89pgj",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "stomachWaterHold": 1.5,
  "stomachTurnDuration": 6,
  "stomachDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "……",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [
        "这里是什么地方？",
        "你的话好像还没说完。"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_zxsxiem5xi",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "我们好像被一只大怪兽吞进肚子里了",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [
        "……"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_npllgzed42",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "怎么会这样，我的人生怎么会这样。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [
        "你怎么了？",
        "你能不能把话说清楚。"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_7id2bgwjwd",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "你看到我胸前的倒计时了吗？等到倒计时结束，我就会马上爆炸，威力足以把一整颗行星炸碎！",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [
        "为什么会这样？",
        "爆炸表演收费吗？"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_uh2xm70wzu",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "不应该这样……不应该这样……明明我已经拼尽全力了。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_7pcczfersi",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "这个星系不应该有人，我们也不应该被关在这个肚子里。不应该这样！",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_eektw4y9ro",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "我一定会挽回这一切的，等一下，等我一下，我马上就能想到办法。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [
        "……"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_3ncz4cf0em",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null
      ]
    }
  ],
