  "farewellShake": 0.35,
  "farewellDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "嘿……我……我想已经来不及了……",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_86iltm7gvt",
      "timerAction": {
        "kind": "set",
        "seconds": 30
      },
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但是我并不难受，我想明白了一件事。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_71mkfgo3dp",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "虽然灾难是我带来的，但是我也算救了你们对吗？",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_2b1jbbr5wo",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "这就是我一直想完成的正义，我做到了！",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_9gkhlp0li1",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "所以不要为我难过，总之谢谢你……还有这只大家伙……",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_14x2btsj0g",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "谢谢你们的出现，不然我就该很傻地等死了。再见！",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_q7ijumpe3t",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
